// Signing settings shared by both app targets (D-051). No team id is committed: a build Mac that
// signs keeps it in the gitignored Config/Signing.local.xcconfig (`DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = <team id>`),
// and the scripts pass DEVELOPMENT_TEAM on the command line. With neither, the macOS target signs
// ad hoc and the iOS Simulator build signs to run locally, which is what CI does.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
